        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n    subgraph UserLayer[\&quot;👤 User Layer\&quot;]\n        CLI[CLI - Click/Rich]\n        API[REST API - FastAPI]\n        UI[Web Dashboard]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Orchestrator[\&quot;🎼 Orchestrator Layer\&quot;]\n        Scheduler[APScheduler]\n        Core[Orchestrator Service]\n        RBAC[RBAC + Audit]\n    end\n\n    subgraph CoreServices[\&quot;⚙️ Core Services\&quot;]\n        BackupMgr[Backup Manager]\n        DiffEngine[Diff Engine]\n        RestoreMgr[Restore Manager]\n        PerfMonitor[Performance Monitor]\n        Notifier[Notifier Service]\n    end\n\n    subgraph DriverLayer[\&quot;🔌 Driver Layer (Plugins)\&quot;]\n        direction LR\n        CiscoDrv[Cisco IOS/XE]\n        JuniperDrv[Juniper JunOS]\n        HuaweiDrv[Huawei VRP]\n        AristaDrv[Arista EOS]\n    end\n\n    subgraph DataLayer[\&quot;💾 Data Layer\&quot;]\n        MetaDB[(PostgreSQL)]\n        TimeDB[(InfluxDB)]\n        GitRepo[(Git Repo)]\n        Vault[(Vault/.env)]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Devices[\&quot;🌐 Network Devices\&quot;]\n        R1((Cisco Router))\n        R2((Juniper Switch))\n        R3((Huawei FW))\n    end\n\n    CLI --&gt; Core\n    API --&gt; Core\n    UI --&gt; API\n    Scheduler --&gt; Core\n    RBAC --&gt; Vault\n\n    Core --&gt; BackupMgr\n    Core --&gt; DiffEngine\n    Core --&gt; RestoreMgr\n    Core --&gt; PerfMonitor\n    Core --&gt; Notifier\n\n    BackupMgr --&gt; CiscoDrv\n    BackupMgr --&gt; JuniperDrv\n    PerfMonitor --&gt; CiscoDrv\n    RestoreMgr --&gt; CiscoDrv\n\n    CiscoDrv -. SSH/NETCONF .-&gt; R1\n    JuniperDrv -. SSH/NETCONF .-&gt; R2\n    HuaweiDrv -. SSH/NETCONF .-&gt; R3\n\n    BackupMgr --&gt; GitRepo\n    BackupMgr --&gt; MetaDB\n    DiffEngine --&gt; MetaDB\n    PerfMonitor --&gt; TimeDB\n    Notifier -. Alert .-&gt; External[Slack/Email/Telegram]&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="D